# BPUT CMS - Frontend Environment Variables Template
# -----------------------------------------------------------------------------

# IMPORTANT: For local development, you DO NOT need this file! 
# Vite's built-in proxy handles local API routing automatically.

# For PRODUCTION (Vercel, Netlify, etc.), you MUST set this variable in your hosting dashboard
# to point to your live backend API URL:
# VITE_API_URL="https://your-backend-api-url.onrender.com/api"
